{"model":"gpt-6-luna","instructions":"## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that follows the provided JSON Schema.\n\nSchema name: `PersonProfile`\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-title\": \"PersonProfile\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"age\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"default\": 0\n        },\n        \"hobbies\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"description\": \"Correctly extract items of type: string\"\n            },\n            \"default\": []\n        }\n    },\n    \"x-php-class\": \"PersonProfile\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n}","input":[{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Jason is 25 years old. He lives in San Francisco. He enjoys soccer, climbing,\nand cooking."}]}],"max_output_tokens":384,"stream":true,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"PersonProfile","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","default":""},"age":{"type":"integer","default":0},"hobbies":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","description":"Correctly extract items of type: string"},"default":[]}},"additionalProperties":false,"required":["name","age","hobbies"]},"strict":true}}}